A file beside the game is asked for by its plain name.

A disc's description (.cue) names its track files, and Mednafen opens them as
"./name" when the description itself was opened as "name". The sandbox
knows a project's files by the names they were mounted under, so "./name" is
not found there. The plain name is the same file everywhere.

--- a/src/VirtualFS.cpp
+++ b/src/VirtualFS.cpp
@@ -164,6 +164,13 @@
 
  if(is_absolute_path(rel_path))
   return rel_path;
+#if defined(CHIMERA_CORE)
+ // chimera: a file beside one that was opened by its plain name is asked for
+ // by its plain name too ("track.bin", not "./track.bin"): the sandbox knows
+ // a project's files by the names they were mounted under.
+ else if(dir_path == "." || dir_path.empty())
+  return rel_path;
+#endif
  else
   return dir_path + preferred_path_separator + rel_path;
 }
